msgid "Autocomplete visibility"
msgstr ""

msgid "Control your visibility in autocomplete suggestions"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"When enabled, your account does not show up in suggestions when others type "
"part of your name, for example in the share dialog or when mentioning "
"someone in a comment. Typing your exact username, full name or email address "
"still finds you."
msgstr ""

msgid "Hide from autocomplete suggestions"
msgstr ""

msgid "Blocked groups saved"
msgstr ""

msgid "Failed to save the blocked groups"
msgstr ""

msgid "Blocked groups"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Nobody can share files or folders with these groups, and they do not show up "
"in suggestions, for example in the share dialog. Use this for large groups "
"that are only meant for configuration, such as enabling an app for everyone. "
"Existing shares keep working, but cannot get more permissions. Calendars, "
"address books and teams that contain such a group are not covered."
msgstr ""

